hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1856","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Kya main tum se wo hadees bayan na karun jis ko main ne Rasoolullah se suna hai aur mere baad koi aisa shakhs tum se ye hadees bayan na karay ga jis ne us ko Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna ho. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke qayamat ki nishaniyon mein se aik ye hai ke ilm uth jaye ga aur jahalat phail jaye gi aur zina khullam khulla ho ga aur sharaab pi jaye gi aur mard kam ho jayein ge, yahan tak ke pachaas auraton ke liye aik mard ho ga jo un ki khabargiri karay ga, yani laraiyon mein bohat saaray mard maaray jayein ge, aur aurtein reh jayein gi. (Muslim: 8/58). Baab: Ilm ka uth jana. (Qayyim se murad khabargiri karnay wala hai.)"
"1857","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Zamana qareeb ho jaye ga aur ilm utha liya jaye ga, yani zamana qayamat ke qareeb ho jaye ga, aur, aalam mein, fitnay phail jayein ge. Aur dilon mein bakheeli daal di jaye gi, log zakaat aur khairaat na dein ge, aur harj bohat ho ga. Logon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Harj kya hai? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke kusht o khoon, yani qatl o khoonraizi. (Muslim: 8/59). Baab: Ulama ke uth janay se ilm ka uth jana. (Shuh se murad bakheeli hai.)"
"1858","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke Allah Azza wa Jal us tarah ilm nahi uthaye ga ke logon ke dilon se chheen le, lekin us tarah uthaye ga ke aalimon ko utha le ga yahan tak ke jab koi aalim na rahay ga to log jahilon ko apne sardaar bana lein ge. Un se sawal kiya jaye ga to wo baghair ilm ke fatwa dein ge. Wo khud bhi gumrah hon ge aur doosron ko bhi gumrah karein ge. (Muslim: 8/60). Baab: Jo Islam mein achi ya buri rasm jari karay."
"1859","[AI-translation] Jarir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Kuch airaabi log Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye wo kambal pehnay hue thay. Pas Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ka bura haal dekha to logon ko sadqa denay ki raghbat dilayi. Logon ne sadqa denay mein dair ki, yahan tak ke us baat ka ranj Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke chehray par maloom hua. Phir aik Ansaari shakhs rupon ki aik thaili le kar aaya, phir doosra aaya, yahan tak ke, sadqa aur khairaat ka, taar bandh gaya aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke chehray par khushi maloom honay lagi. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs Islam mein acha tareeqa jaari karay, yani umda kaam ko jaari karay jo shariat ki ro se sawab ho aur us ka namoona Quran o sunnat mein maujood ho, phir log us ke baad us kaam par amal karein to us ko itna sawab ho ga jitna sab amal karnay walon ko ho ga aur un ke sawab mein kuch kami na ho gi. Aur jo shakhs Islam mein bura tareeqa jaari karay to us par us ka bhi gunah ho ga aur un logon ka bhi jo us ke baad us par amal karein aur un ke gunah mein kuch kami na ho gi. (Muslim). Baab: Hidayat ya gumrahi ki taraf bulanay wala."
"1860","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs hidayat ki taraf bulaye, us ko hidayat par chalnay walon ka bhi sawab milay ga aur chalnay walon ka sawab kuch kam na ho ga aur jo shakhs gumrahi ki taraf bulaye ga, us ko gunah par chalnay walon ka bhi gunah ho ga aur chalnay walon ka gunah kuch kam na ho ga. (Muslim: 8/62). Baab: Quran likhnay aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par jhoot se khabardaar karna."
"1861","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mera kalaam, mujh se mat likho aur jis ne kuch mujh se sun kar likha ho to wo us ko mita daalay magar Quran ko na mitaye. Albatta meri hadees bayan karo us mein kuch haraj nahi aur jis ne qasdan mujh par jhoot baandha, wo apna thikana jahannam mein bana le. (Muslim: 8/229). (Ye mansookh hai, hadees likhnay ka hukm baad mein aaya; mutaammidan ka lafz tawatur se sabit hai.)"
"1862","[AI-translation] Mughira bin Shuba (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke mere upar jhoot baandhna aisa nahi hai jaisay kisi aur par jhoot baandhna, kyunke aur kisi par jhoot baandhnay se jhoot bolnay walay ka nuqsan ho ga ya jis par jhoot baandha us ka bhi ya aur teen aadmiyon ka sahi. Lekin Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par jhoot baandhnay se aik aalam gumrah ho ga aur duniya ko nuqsan pahunche ga. Phir jo shakhs mujh par qasdan jhoot baandhay, wo apna thikana jahannam mein bana le. (Muslim: 1/8)"
"1863","[AI-translation] Samura bin Jundab aur Mughira bin Shuba (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs mujh se hadees naqal karay aur wo khayal karta ho ke ye jhoot hai, to wo khud jhoota hai. (Muslim: 1/7)"
